questions.text:
Match the electronic configurations in List-I with appropriate metal complex ions in List-II and choose the correct option. [Atomic Number: Fe = 26, Mn = 25, Co = 27]

List-I
(P) t_{2g}^6 e_g^0 (1)
(Q) t_{2g}^3 e_g^2 (2)
(R) e^2 t_2^3 (3)
(S) t_{4 2g} e_g^2 (4)

List-II
[Fe(H₂O)₆]^{2+}
[Mn(H₂O)₆]^{2+}
[Co(NH₃)₆]^{3+}
[FeCl₄]^-
[CoCl₄]^{2-}
